      <rules>
        <rule name="A Death Long Foreseen" id="bb3c-af82-a6a9-1de9" hidden="false">
          <description>Konrad Curze gains access to the Glimpse of Death Psychic Power only and gains no other Disciplines.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="The King of Terrors" id="00a2-396d-6e1c-183a" hidden="false">
          <description>When Konrad Curze and any unit he has joined ends a combat by removing all enemy models as casualties or destroying an enemy unit due to a Sweeping Advance, all enemy units that are not locked in combat and can draw a line of sight to Konrad Curze must immediately take a Pinning test.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
