            <profile name="Glimpse of Death" id="72a8-7690-93a9-25fc" hidden="false" typeId="5405-b3c6-e8d0-4e77" typeName="Psychic Power">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c0f-7e2f-586c-9305">At the start of any Assault phase, a Psychic check may be made for Konrad Curze by the controlling player, this Psychic check msy be made against a Leadership of 7. If this Check is passed, Konrad Cruze gains the Feel No Pain (4+) special rule and +1 Attacks for the duration of that Assault phase. If the Check is failed, Konrad Curze suffers Perils of the Warp.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </selectionEntry>
