          <profiles>
            <profile name="Aberrant Bravery" id="ab6a-bf89-f06f-8fa9" hidden="false" typeId="a0e6-a7b4-d55d-85b8" typeName="Warlord Trait">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="c68e-2cda-b67b-baca">If Kheron Ophion’s controlling player is controlling fewer Objectives than their opponent, Ophion and any Night Lords units within 12&quot; of him gain the Stubborn special rule. In addition, an army whose Warlord is Kheron Ophion may make an additional Reaction in the opposing player’s Movement phase, as long as Kheron Ophion has not been removed as a casualty.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </entryLink>
